#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "PayCrypto.Me for WooCommerce"
msgstr "PayCrypto.Me для WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://paycrypto.me/woocommerce/"
msgstr "https://paycrypto.me/woocommerce/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"PayCrypto.Me for WooCommerce lets your store accept Bitcoin payments — On-"
"Chain and Lightning Network — directly into wallets and nodes you control."
msgstr ""
"PayCrypto.Me для WooCommerce позволяет вашему магазину принимать платежи в "
"Bitcoin — On-Chain и Lightning Network — непосредственно в кошельки и узлы, "
"которыми вы управляете."

#. Author of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "PayCrypto.Me"
msgstr "PayCrypto.Me"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://paycrypto.me/"
msgstr "https://paycrypto.me/"

#: exceptions/PayCryptoMePaymentException.php:19
msgid ""
"We couldn't complete your payment. Please try again or contact support if "
"the problem persists."
msgstr ""
"Не удалось завершить платёж. Попробуйте снова или обратитесь в поддержку, "
"если проблема повторяется."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:140
msgid ""
"We could not display the payment details for this order. Please contact the "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Не удалось показать платёжные данные этого заказа. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь с "
"магазином."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:236
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Сеть"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:239
msgid "Select the network for payments."
msgstr "Выберите сеть для платежей."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:248
msgid "Enable Method"
msgstr "Включить метод"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:249
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Включить"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:254
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Название"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:256
msgid "Payment method name displayed on Checkout page."
msgstr "Название способа оплаты, отображаемое на странице оформления заказа."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:257
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:34
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:38
msgid "Pay with Bitcoin"
msgstr "Оплатить Bitcoin"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:260
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Описание"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:262
msgid "Payment method description displayed on Checkout page."
msgstr "Описание способа оплаты, отображаемое на странице оформления заказа."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:263
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:35
msgid ""
"Pay directly from your Bitcoin wallet. Place your order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Платите прямо со своего кошелька Bitcoin. Разместите заказ, чтобы увидеть QR-"
"код и инструкции по оплате."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:267
msgid "Express Payment (One-Click)"
msgstr "Экспресс-платеж (один клик)"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:268
msgid ""
"Enable Express Payment to pay with one click. When enabled, customers are "
"redirected straight to the payment QR code."
msgstr ""
"Включить экспресс-платеж для оплаты одним щелчком. Если эта опция включена, "
"покупатели будут перенаправлены прямо на QR-код платежа."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:271
msgid "Enable Express Payment"
msgstr "Включить экспресс-платеж"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:277
msgid "Express Button Label"
msgstr "Метка кнопки Express"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:278
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:42
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:47
msgid "Buy with"
msgstr "Купить"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:279
msgid ""
"Text displayed on the Express Payment button. If empty, the default label "
"will be used 'Buy with'"
msgstr ""
"Текст, отображаемый на кнопке экспресс-платежа. Если оставить пустым, будет "
"использована метка по умолчанию 'Купить'"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:286
msgid "Express Button Icon"
msgstr "Значок кнопки Express"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:287
msgid "Show icon on Express Payment button"
msgstr "Показать значок на кнопке экспресс-платежа"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:290
msgid ""
"When enabled, the payment network icon is displayed alongside the button "
"label."
msgstr "При включении значок сети платежей отображается рядом с меткой кнопки."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:293
msgid "Icon Position"
msgstr "Позиция значка"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:296
msgid ""
"Controls where the icon appears relative to the button label. e.g. \"₿ Pay "
"with\" (left) or \"Pay with ₿\" (right)."
msgstr ""
"Контролирует расположение значка относительно метки кнопки. Например, \"₿ "
"Оплатить\" (слева) или \"Оплатить ₿\" (справа)."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:298
msgid "Left — icon before label"
msgstr "Слева — значок перед меткой"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:299
msgid "Right — icon after label"
msgstr "Справа — значок после метки"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:307
msgid "Hide for Non-Admin Users"
msgstr "Скрыть для пользователей не-администраторов"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:308
msgid "Show only for administrators."
msgstr "Показать только администраторам."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:311
msgid ""
"If enabled, only administrators will see the payment method on Checkout page."
msgstr ""
"При включении только администраторы будут видеть способ оплаты на странице "
"оформления заказа."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:314
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Отладка"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:315
msgid "Enable debugging messages"
msgstr "Включить сообщения отладки"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:318
msgid "Debug logs will be saved to WooCommerce > Status > Logs."
msgstr "Логи отладки будут сохранены в WooCommerce > Статус > Логи."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:322
msgid "Support the development!"
msgstr "Поддержите разработку!"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:328
msgid "<strong>Enjoying the plugin?</strong> Send some BTC to support:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Вам нравится плагин?</strong> Отправьте немного BTC в поддержку:"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:331
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Копировать"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:565
msgid "Pro · Coming soon"
msgstr "Pro · Скоро"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:28
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
msgid "Bitcoin Payments"
msgstr "Платежи Bitcoin"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:28
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:364
msgid "Lightning Network"
msgstr "Lightning Network"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:29
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments self-hosted via Lightning Network"
msgstr ""
"Принимайте платежи Bitcoin через самохостируемую сеть Lightning Network"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:29
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Provided by PayCrypto.Me"
msgstr "Предоставлено PayCrypto.Me"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:106
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Настройки прокси"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:108
msgid "Configure proxy settings for connecting to your Lightning node."
msgstr "Настройте параметры прокси для подключения к узлу Lightning."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:111
msgid "Lightning Node Type"
msgstr "Тип узла Lightning"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:116
msgid "Invoice Expiry"
msgstr "Срок действия счета"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:118
msgid ""
"Time before invoice expires. Min: 300 (5 min), Max: 86400 (24h). Default: "
"3600 (1 hour)"
msgstr ""
"Время до истечения счета. Мин: 300 (5 мин), Макс: 86400 (24ч). По умолчанию: "
"3600 (1 час)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:129
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:386
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:38
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:45
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:50
msgid "BTCPay Server URL"
msgstr "URL сервера BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:131
msgid "Full URL to your BTCPay Server (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "Полный URL вашего сервера BTCPay (требуется HTTPS)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:138
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:387
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:69
msgid "BTCPay API Key"
msgstr "API ключ BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:140
msgid "API key for BTCPay (min 20 characters)."
msgstr "Ключ API для BTCPay (минимум 20 символов)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:146
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:388
msgid "BTCPay Store ID"
msgstr "ID магазина BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:148
msgid "Your BTCPay store identifier."
msgstr "Идентификатор вашего магазина BTCPay."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:153
msgid "BTCPay Lightning Payment Method ID (advanced)"
msgstr "ID метода платежа Lightning в BTCPay (продвинутые)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:155
msgid ""
"Only change this if your BTCPay Server version reports a different Lightning "
"payment method identifier than the default. Leave as \"BTC-LN\" unless "
"instructed otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Изменяйте только если ваша версия сервера BTCPay сообщает другой "
"идентификатор метода платежа Lightning. Оставьте как \"BTC-LN\", если не "
"указано иное."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:162
msgid "BTCPay Connection Test"
msgstr "Проверка подключения BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:167
msgid "Webhook Configuration"
msgstr "Конфигурация Webhook"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:169
msgid ""
"Automatic payment confirmation via webhooks (BTCPay push / lnd polling) "
"ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me Pro add-on. In the free version, "
"Lightning payments are confirmed manually — the settings below are a preview "
"and are not editable yet."
msgstr ""
"Автоматическое подтверждение платежей через веб-хуки (push от BTCPay / опрос "
"lnd) появится в будущем дополнении Pro от PayCrypto.Me. В бесплатной версии "
"платежи Lightning подтверждаются вручную — настройки ниже показаны для "
"предпросмотра и пока недоступны для редактирования."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:172
msgid "BTCPay Webhook Secret"
msgstr "Секрет Webhook BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:174
msgid "Reserved for the Pro add-on. Not used by the free version."
msgstr ""
"Зарезервировано для дополнения Pro. Не используется в бесплатной версии."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:175
msgid "Available in the Pro add-on"
msgstr "Доступно в дополнении Pro"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:183
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:382
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:68
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:103
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:108
msgid "lnd REST URL"
msgstr "URL lnd REST"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:185
msgid "REST API endpoint (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "Endpoint REST API (требуется HTTPS)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:192
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:383
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:120
msgid "lnd Macaroon (hex)"
msgstr "Macaroon lnd (hex)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:194
msgid "Admin macaroon in hexadecimal format (min 100 characters)."
msgstr ""
"Администраторский macaroon в шестнадцатеричном формате (минимум 100 "
"символов)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:200
msgid "SSL Certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "Сертификат SSL (PEM)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:202
msgid ""
"Optional: Paste your SSL certificate in PEM format. If provided, this will "
"be used for verification instead of disabling SSL checks."
msgstr ""
"Опционально: Вставьте ваш сертификат SSL в формате PEM. Если предоставлен, "
"он будет использоваться для проверки вместо отключения проверок SSL."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:208
msgid "Verify SSL Certificate"
msgstr "Проверить сертификат SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:210
msgid "Enable SSL certificate verification"
msgstr "Включить проверку сертификата SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:211
msgid ""
"Enable for production. If disabled and no certificate is provided, SSL "
"verification is skipped (development only)."
msgstr ""
"Включите для производства. Если отключено и сертификат не предоставлен, "
"проверка SSL пропускается (только разработка)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:216
msgid "lnd REST Connection Test"
msgstr "Проверка подключения lnd REST"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:283
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:319
msgid "🔌 Test connection"
msgstr "🔌 Проверить подключение"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:359
msgid "On-Chain"
msgstr "On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments Non-custodial via On-Chain"
msgstr "Принимайте платежи Bitcoin без хранения ключей через On-Chain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:39
msgid ""
"Use directly your Bitcoin wallet to pay. Place the order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Используйте напрямую ваш кошелек Bitcoin для оплаты. Разместите заказ, чтобы "
"увидеть QR-код и инструкции по оплате."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:259
msgid "Wallet xPub"
msgstr "xPub кошелька"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:268
msgid "Testnet Wallet xPub"
msgstr "xPub кошелька Testnet"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:283
msgid "Network Identifier"
msgstr "Идентификатор сети"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:287
msgid ""
"Tip: It is always preferable to use the wallet xPub rather than a wallet "
"address for Bitcoin payments."
msgstr ""
"Совет: Всегда предпочтительнее использовать xPub кошелька, чем адрес "
"кошелька для платежей Bitcoin."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:291
msgid "Payment Timeout (hours)"
msgstr "Таймаут платежа (часов)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:293
msgid ""
"Automatic order expiry after the timeout ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Pro add-on. In the free version, on-chain addresses stay valid until paid."
msgstr ""
"Автоматическое истечение срока заказа по тайм-ауту появится в будущем "
"дополнении Pro от PayCrypto.Me. В бесплатной версии адреса on-chain остаются "
"действительными до оплаты."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:299
msgid "Payment number of confirmations"
msgstr "Количество подтверждений платежа"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:301
msgid ""
"Automatic on-chain confirmation tracking ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Pro add-on. In the free version, payments are verified manually."
msgstr ""
"Автоматическое отслеживание подтверждений on-chain появится в будущем "
"дополнении Pro от PayCrypto.Me. В бесплатной версии платежи проверяются "
"вручную."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:308
msgid "Danger Area"
msgstr "Опасная зона"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:311
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Предупреждение:"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:311
msgid ""
"Resetting the payment derivation index will lead to the reuse of addresses "
"and loss of past data. Proceed with caution and ensure you understand the "
"implications."
msgstr ""
"Сброс индекса производной адреса платежа приведет к повторному использованию "
"адресов и потере прошлых данных. Действуйте осторожно и убедитесь, что вы "
"понимаете последствия."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:313
msgid "Reset payment address derivation index"
msgstr "Сброс индекса производной адреса платежа"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:360
msgid "Testnet"
msgstr "Testnet"

#: includes/processors/abstract-class-lightning-processor.php:85
msgid ""
"We could not save your Lightning invoice. Please try again or contact the "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Не удалось сохранить ваш Lightning-инвойс. Попробуйте ещё раз или свяжитесь "
"с магазином."

#: includes/processors/abstract-class-lightning-processor.php:167
msgid ""
"Your Lightning invoice is taking longer than expected to generate. Please "
"try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Создание вашей счета Lightning занимает больше времени, чем ожидалось. "
"Пожалуйста, повторите попытку через минуту."

#: includes/processors/class-bitcoin-payment-processor.php:129
msgid ""
"We could not register your payment. Please try again or contact the store."
msgstr ""
"Не удалось зарегистрировать ваш платёж. Попробуйте ещё раз или свяжитесь с "
"магазином."

#. translators: 1: payment address, 2: order reference number.
#: includes/processors/class-bitcoin-payment-processor.php:208
#, php-format
